    {
      "id": "vu7y9-Qdy2GWMz7BTviS_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11806.564410344768,
      "y": 5697.843504522346,
      "width": 230.41522216796875,
      "height": 412.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 36792798,
      "version": 608,
      "versionNonce": 2016765342,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789283145647,
      "created": 1789282874857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "el = [1]\n\nwhat does it needs ? \nel+1 = 2;\nneeds[2]++;\nneeds[2] = 1;\n\nthen check the next element : \nif(needs[2]>0) -> extend the subsequence;\n\narr = [1, 2] what we need next ? 3!\n\nneeds[2]-- => needs[2] = 0;\nneeds[2]++ => needs[3] = 1;\n\ndoes needs[3] > 0? Yes!\n\nextends the subsequence : \narr = [1, 2, 3]\n\nwhat do we need next ? needs 4;\ntherefore, needs[3]-- => needs[3] = 0;\nneeds[4] = 1;\n\nextends  : \nas\nneeds[4] > 0\narr = [1, 2, 3, 4]\n\nthen we have similarly [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] ",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "el = [1]\n\nwhat does it needs ? \nel+1 = 2;\nneeds[2]++;\nneeds[2] = 1;\n\nthen check the next element : \nif(needs[2]>0) -> extend the subsequence;\n\narr = [1, 2] what we need next ? 3!\n\nneeds[2]-- => needs[2] = 0;\nneeds[2]++ => needs[3] = 1;\n\ndoes needs[3] > 0? Yes!\n\nextends the subsequence : \narr = [1, 2, 3]\n\nwhat do we need next ? needs 4;\ntherefore, needs[3]-- => needs[3] = 0;\nneeds[4] = 1;\n\nextends  : \nas\nneeds[4] > 0\narr = [1, 2, 3, 4]\n\nthen we have similarly [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
